      ],
      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL         RAGGED HALL LANE                                                (north side)                                                POTTERS CROUCH 9/301                                          Holly Bush Cottage 25.3.81 GV                  II House.  Early-mid Cl7.   Exposed timber frame,  ground floor with painted brick.   Plaster.   Weatherboarding.   Plain tile roof with dark red brick chimney stack of 4 square flues near gable end.   Probably once another bay towards road.   2 storeys.  Upper floor on E side has 2 small C19 glazing bar casements, the ground floor with door and twin casements.  Rear elevation with a door and twin casement.  Interior with staircase attached to stack. Listing NGR: TL1165005245"
    }
